# Privacy Policy — Pocket Convert

**Last Updated: October 17, 2026**

Pocket Convert is a unit conversion application designed to make everyday conversions simple and convenient. Your privacy is important to us. This Privacy Policy explains how the app handles your information.

## 1. Personal Information

Pocket Convert does not directly collect personal information through its core conversion features. The app does not require users to create an account or provide their name, email address, phone number, or other personal details to use the converter.

## 2. Offline Functionality

Pocket Convert performs its core conversion calculations directly on your device. An internet connection is not required for basic conversion functionality.

## 3. Local App Data

The app may store information locally on your device to provide its features, including:

- Favorite conversions
- Recent conversion history
- Selected units
- Decimal precision preferences
- Theme and app settings

This information is used to maintain your preferences and improve your experience. It is not uploaded to our own servers.

## 4. Conversion Values

Values entered for conversion are processed locally on your device to calculate the requested results. We do not receive or store these values on our own servers.

## 5. Data Sharing

We do not sell personal information. Pocket Convert does not use a developer-operated server to collect your conversion history or personal conversion values.

## 6. Third-Party Services

Pocket Convert is designed to provide its core functionality without requiring third-party advertising, analytics, or cloud services.

If third-party services are introduced in a future version, this policy will be updated to reflect any applicable data practices.

## 7. Permissions

Pocket Convert does not require sensitive permissions such as location, camera, microphone, contacts, or phone access for its core conversion features.

The permissions present in a particular release may depend on the final app configuration and its included dependencies.

## 8. Data Security

Your locally stored favorites, conversion history, and preferences remain on your device. We do not have access to this locally stored information through our own servers.

Please keep your device secure to protect information stored on it.

## 9. Data Retention and Deletion

Pocket Convert does not maintain a server-side account containing your conversion history or app preferences.

You can generally remove locally stored app data by clearing the app's data through your device settings or uninstalling the app.

## 10. Children's Privacy

Pocket Convert does not knowingly collect personal information from children through its core functionality.

## 11. Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy when app features or data practices change. Updates will be published on this page with a revised "Last Updated" date.

